  "label": "Ableism",
  "description": "Discrimination or prejudice against people with disabilities, often manifesting as the belief that people with disabilities are less capable, less worthy, or a burden on society. While not directly applicable here, the meme's degrading language and focus on appearance can be seen as a form of ableist thinking when it reduces a person's worth to their physical or perceived 'defects'.",
